" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A Decade of Teaching \u2014 From South Delhi to the USA<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-254d866 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"254d866\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Shikha&#8217;s journey as a yoga teacher has taken her from the leafy streets of South Delhi to international studios in the United States, where she taught Vinyasa Flow to diverse audiences across cultures. That global experience sharpened her ability to meet every student exactly where they are \u2014 and guide them somewhere they didn&#8217;t know they could go.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7ebc109 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"7ebc109\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:300}\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d12dbcb elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"d12dbcb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Yoga Inner Power Approach \u2014 Science Meets Wisdom<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5abc6e2 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5abc6e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Most yoga teachers teach poses. Shikha teaches your body. Her background in anatomy means she understands why your lower back hurts, where your tension actually lives, and what your specific body needs \u2014 not what a generic class prescribes. Every session at Yoga Inner Power in South Delhi is tailored, thoughtful, and built around you.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-314c13e elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"314c13e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:100}\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">What Shikha's Students in South Delhi Say<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6535b17 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6535b17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>From cardiologists who came in sceptical and left converted, to software developers who finally got rid of decade-long back pain, to entrepreneurs who found mental clarity on the mat \u2014 Shikha&#8217;s students in Greater Kailash, Hauz Khas, Vasant Vihar, and across South Delhi consistently describe the same experience: they came for the yoga,