 Transformation Meet Shikha Arya \u2014 Your Yoga Teacher in South Delhi Shikha Arya is one of South Delhi&#8217;s most experienced and sought-after yoga teachers. With over a decade dedicated entirely to yoga and holistic wellness, she brings something rare to the mat: a genuine understanding of the human body rooted in anatomy and medical science, combined with the depth and wisdom of authentic yogic tradition. About yogainner Power Unlocking Inner Power Through a Unique Fusion of Science, Spirit, and Discipline. For over a decade, Shikha Arya has dedicated her life to mastering and teaching the arts of holistic well-being. She is not just a yoga instructor; she is a certified guide with a rare and powerful background that integrates the precision of medical science, the discipline of language, and the profound wisdom of ancient yogic traditions. Her journey is a testament to a lifelong passion for empowering individuals to unlock their fullest potential. A Decade of Dedication: With over 10 years exclusively in the wellness field, Shikha possesses a refined understanding of what it takes to create lasting transformation. A Certified Yoga Expert: Her journey is one of both practice and pedagogy. She is an experienced instructor who has successfully taught dynamic styles like Vinyasa Flow internationally. Global Teaching Experience: Shikha honed her craft and shared her knowledge with diverse audiences in the United States, adapting her teachings to various needs and cultures. Experience 0 + Global Reach 0 + Holistic Mastery 0 With over a decade of expertise, Shikha Arya guides you beyond the mat to unlock lasting strength, clarity, and inner power through the conscious movement of yoga. Read More Physical Postures Foundational asanas build strength, increase flexibility, and cultivate mindful alignment to harmonize body and mind. Breathing Techniques Master conscious breath control to energize your body, calm your mind, and deepen the profound connection between m